id":"ac545009-d8f7-4c35-b4f3-7bbc804eb41a","name":"Contact Conversations","credentials":{"chatwootApi":{"id":"br8oDVCUJbhcYO2q","name":"ChatWoot account"}}},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"// n8n Code node (JavaScript)\n// Objetivo: achar a conversa MAIS RECENTE e retornar o ID dela\n\n// 1) Coleta todas as conversas do(s) item(s) de entrada\nconst allInputs = $input.all();\n\nlet conversations = [];\nfor (const it of allInputs) {\n  const payload = it.json?.payload;\n  if (Array.isArray(payload)) conversations.push(...payload);\n}\n\n// Se seu node anterior devolve exatamente 1 item com payload, isso já resolve.\n// Se não tiver nada, devolve vazio com motivo.\nif (!conversations.length) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      erro: true,\n      motivo: 'Nenhuma conversa encontrada em json.payload',\n      ultimoChatId: null,\n    }\n  }];\n}\n\n// 2) Função para extrair \"data\" em número, com fallback\nfunction toEpochSeconds(conv) {\n  // Preferência: last_activity_at (já vem em epoch seconds)\n  if (typeof conv?.last_activity_at === 'number') return conv.last_activity_at;\n  if (typeof conv?.timestamp === 'number') return conv.timestamp;\n\n  // Às vezes isso vem dentro do último message\n  const msg0 = Array.isArray(conv?.messages) && conv.messages[0] ? conv.messages[0] : null;\n  if (typeof msg0?.created_at === 'number') return msg0.created_at;\n\n  // Fallback ISO date (updated_at) -> seconds\n  const iso = conv?.updated_at || msg0?.updated_at;\n  if (typeof iso === 'string') {\n    const ms = Date.parse(iso);\n    if (!Number.isNaN(ms)) return Math.floor(ms / 1000);\n  }\n\n  // Último fallback: created_at (epoch seconds)\n  if (typeof conv?.created_at === 'number') return conv.created_at;\n\n  // Se nada existir, joga lá pra baixo\n  return 0;\n}\n\n// 3) Ordena e pega a mais recente\nconversations.sort((a, b) => toEpochSeconds(b) - toEpochSeconds(a));\nconst latest = conversations[0];\n\n// 4) Retorna o que importa\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ultimoChatId: latest.id ?? null,\n    ultimoChatUuid: latest.uuid ?? null,\n    ultimoChatInboxId: latest.inbox_id ?? null,\n    ultimoChatStatus: latest.status ?? null,\n    ultimoChatLastActivityAt: latest.last_activity_at ?? latest.timestamp ?? toEpochSeconds(latest),\n    ultimoChat: latest,\n  }\n}];\n"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[2240,0],"id":"90e88e3c-df00-4f5a-949a-8071bb8186c9","name":"Code in JavaScript2"}],"connections":{"Pagina":{"main":[[{"node":"HTML","type":"main","index":0}]]},"HTML":{"main":[[{"node":"Respond to Webhook","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Requisiçao ":{"main":[[{"node":"List all sessions","type":"main","index":0}]]},"List all sessions":{"main":[[{"node":"Filter","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Filter":{"main":[[{"node":"Code in JavaScript","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Code in JavaScript":{"main":[[{"node":"Code in JavaScript1","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Code in JavaScript1":{"main":[[{"node":"Check phone number is registered in WhatsApp.","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Check phone number is registered in WhatsApp.":{"main":[[{"node":"If","type":"main","index":0}]]},"If":{"main":[[{"node":"Send a text message1","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Respond to Webhook1","type":"main","index":0}]]},"List all sessions1":{"main":[[{"node":"Filter1","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Filter1":{"main":[[{"node":"Edit Fields","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Edit Fields":{"main":[[{"node":"Respond to Webhook2","type":"main","index":0}]]},"listar numeros disponiveis para envio. ":{"main":[[{"node":"List all sessions1","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Send a text message1":{"main":[[{"node":"Search Contacts","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Search Contacts":{"main":[[{"node":"Contact Conversations","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Contact Conversations":{"main":[[{"node":"Code in JavaScript2","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Code in JavaScript2":{"main":[[{"node":"Respond to Webhook3","type":"main","index":0}]]}},"authors":"Bolsa Mais Brasil","name":"Version 20ddeaf2","desc